 Signed `<` → unsigned compare | 20 tests |\n| Off-by-one skipping the tail node | 21 tests |\n| Renamed export symbol | **all 35**, incl. Phase D |\n\n`src/lib.rs` was then restored and confirmed byte-identical to the original.\n\n## Result\n\n**No divergences found — the Rust required no fixes.** The translation is faithful, including the quirk that a list whose genuine minimum is `-1` is indistinguishable from the NULL-head error (`ERRORS.md` G2 asserts this aliasing is preserved rather than \"fixed\").\n\nOne deliberate omission, recorded in `ERRORS.md` G10: the C has no cycle detection, so a cyclic list makes it spin forever. That is UB/hang, not a value the C returns, so there is nothing to differentially compare — noted so the gap reads as intentional.\n\nFiles added: `SYMBOLS.md`, `ERRORS.md`, `CONFIGS.md`, `run_verification.sh`, `tests/{harness/mod.rs,phase_b_configs.rs,phase_c_errors.rs,phase_d_symbols.rs}`, plus the `libloading` dev-dependency. Nothing in `c_src/` was modified (source mtimes unchanged; only the instructed `build/` directory was added)."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":708,"cache_read_input_tokens":73098,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":708,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9e223553-c09d-431b-b2a1-19e0f48c0e43","uuid":"fa4d9108-c996-4069-aa21-61cab80c7cd5","timestamp":"2026-08-18T03:47:32.671Z"}
